WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,050
Should I go out and get him?

2
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:08,900
Haven't you heard that he is about to die from an infection?

3
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:18,740
I beg you, please give me some medicine

4
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:20,740
I don't want to die

5
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:22,740
You're dead, your wounds are all rotten

6
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:25,740
You won’t be alive in the late stage

7
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,740
It’s better to wait while you’re still alive

8
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,740
I did things that I didn’t dare to do when I was alive.
